Description: Provides an interactive Shiny application for exploring cancer
    clone evolution from longitudinal genomic variant data. The package
    supports preparation, visualization, and statistical analysis of clonal
    trajectories and mutational signatures. It is intended to make these
    analyses accessible through an interactive and reproducible workflow.
